<title>USA: Isis drug shows antitumor action.</title>
<headline>Isis drug shows antitumor action.</headline>
<dateline>CARLSBAD, Calif. 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Isis Pharmaceuticals said Wednesday its anticancer compound ISIS 5132/CGP69846A showed antitumor activity in animals by way of an antisense mechanism of action.</p>
<p>The studies provide evidence, the company said, that the antitumor activity is correlated to the sequence specificity of the compound.</p>
